OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of disruption ahead
OL,4,Aof demolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council has warned
OL,7,Fthere will be "temporary disruption" to
OL,8,Fdrivers during the demolition of a
OL,9,Fmulti-storey car park and former
OL,10,Fcollege site.
OL,12,FThe NCP car park and former Bluecoat
OL,13,Fsixth form college on Maid Marian Way
OL,14,Fare set to be demolished as part of the
OL,15,Fwider redevelopment of the Broad Marsh
OL,16,Farea of the city.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
